{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/05de8aac83c8e52e8cf9273f5ba2096f.poster.avif?t=1773402378\" width=1070 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/05de8aac83c8e52e8cf9273f5ba2096f.webm?t=1773402378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/05de8aac83c8e52e8cf9273f5ba2096f.mp4?t=1773402378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a Gnome</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to invade the houses of unsuspecting humans along with up to 5 friends of your choice. After finding your way in, take anything you want. Human laws don't apply to gnomes! Just try to be stealthy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/f04cd19b1f7c20b86321246d763745bc.poster.avif?t=1773402378\" width=1070 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/f04cd19b1f7c20b86321246d763745bc.webm?t=1773402378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/f04cd19b1f7c20b86321246d763745bc.mp4?t=1773402378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do your job</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While burgling is a very productive activity on its own, you also need to do your job. The High-Gnome won't transport you around for nothing, so you must complete tasks for him to stay on his good side! Failing to complete enough tasks might get you fired...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/67492c6fbe329d0ab303d36414e031ad.poster.avif?t=1773402378\" width=1070 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/67492c6fbe329d0ab303d36414e031ad.webm?t=1773402378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/67492c6fbe329d0ab303d36414e031ad.mp4?t=1773402378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft and Upgrade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the stuff you find is useful as is, however a certain amount of repurposing is often needed to fit the specific needs of gnomes. Craft equipment, build functional furniture, and upgrade your home with the burglin' haul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/85da3c4f28402df6bad6942e6d7b53c7.poster.avif?t=1773402378\" width=1070 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/85da3c4f28402df6bad6942e6d7b53c7.webm?t=1773402378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/85da3c4f28402df6bad6942e6d7b53c7.mp4?t=1773402378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay safe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gnomes are small and fragile, and often hunted by other beings. Interact with the environment and use your equipment to slow down any hostile meanies. Stay vigilant, and be ready to rescue one another. The High-Gnome doesn't like resurrecting unworthy gnomes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/90db26888ffef2b101e4164b456efee1.poster.avif?t=1773402378\" width=1070 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/90db26888ffef2b101e4164b456efee1.webm?t=1773402378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/90db26888ffef2b101e4164b456efee1.mp4?t=1773402378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844970?t=1773402378","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/8aae66e4daff3deeb8068e4060a5b25eac4ad907/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773402378","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/e41b58cdb34075d167e6905d090cd0a7f69c2254/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773402378","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/e41b58cdb34075d167e6905d090cd0a7f69c2254/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773402378","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The human in the game might appear nude to perform activities such as taking a bath. The nudity is censored and can be fully turned off optionally. The gnomes can get dismembered and die in other brutal ways."},"demos":[{"appid":4356080,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/05de8aac83c8e52e8cf9273f5ba2096f.poster.avif?t=1773402378\" width=1070 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/05de8aac83c8e52e8cf9273f5ba2096f.webm?t=1773402378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/05de8aac83c8e52e8cf9273f5ba2096f.mp4?t=1773402378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a Gnome</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to invade the houses of unsuspecting humans along with up to 5 friends of your choice. After finding your way in, take anything you want. Human laws don't apply to gnomes! Just try to be stealthy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/f04cd19b1f7c20b86321246d763745bc.poster.avif?t=1773402378\" width=1070 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/f04cd19b1f7c20b86321246d763745bc.webm?t=1773402378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/f04cd19b1f7c20b86321246d763745bc.mp4?t=1773402378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do your job</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While burgling is a very productive activity on its own, you also need to do your job. The High-Gnome won't transport you around for nothing, so you must complete tasks for him to stay on his good side! Failing to complete enough tasks might get you fired...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/67492c6fbe329d0ab303d36414e031ad.poster.avif?t=1773402378\" width=1070 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/67492c6fbe329d0ab303d36414e031ad.webm?t=1773402378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/67492c6fbe329d0ab303d36414e031ad.mp4?t=1773402378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft and Upgrade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the stuff you find is useful as is, however a certain amount of repurposing is often needed to fit the specific needs of gnomes. Craft equipment, build functional furniture, and upgrade your home with the burglin' haul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/85da3c4f28402df6bad6942e6d7b53c7.poster.avif?t=1773402378\" width=1070 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/85da3c4f28402df6bad6942e6d7b53c7.webm?t=1773402378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/85da3c4f28402df6bad6942e6d7b53c7.mp4?t=1773402378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay safe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gnomes are small and fragile, and often hunted by other beings. Interact with the environment and use your equipment to slow down any hostile meanies. Stay vigilant, and be ready to rescue one another. The High-Gnome doesn't like resurrecting unworthy gnomes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/90db26888ffef2b101e4164b456efee1.poster.avif?t=1773402378\" width=1070 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/90db26888ffef2b101e4164b456efee1.webm?t=1773402378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/90db26888ffef2b101e4164b456efee1.mp4?t=1773402378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Fobri"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/d6127e4eabda23e1d1c727a1875e6b6cb0e634ae/header.jpg?t=1773402378","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3844970/1238182998/7aa03a673cdb57adfa4abf938782a34b972dc3ab/1767210730/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767212913","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3844970/1238182998/7aa03a673cdb57adfa4abf938782a34b972dc3ab/1767210730/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767212913","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3844970/1238182998/7aa03a673cdb57adfa4abf938782a34b972dc3ab/1767210730/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767212913","id":257257508,"name":"Gnomes 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257257508/16562ca7c8acec2ec4fc2d552573aad7478beea9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767212913"}],"name":"Burglin' Gnomes","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<b